{"ticker":"GODREJCP","symbol":"GODREJCP","instrumentId":3022917,"name":"Godrej Consumer Prod","industry":"NSE-Cosmetics/Personal Care","about":"Godrej Consumer Products Ltd. (GCPL) is a major player in the fast-moving consumer goods (FMCG) sector, providing a wide range of products in home care, personal care, and hair care. Operating in over 90 countries, GCPL’s well-known brands include Good Knight (insect repellents), Cinthol (soaps and personal care), and Godrej Expert (hair color). GCPL focuses on innovation, sustainability, and affordable solutions to meet the diverse needs of consumers across emerging markets in Asia, Africa, and Latin America. With a strong commitment to environmental and social impact, the company consistently delivers high-quality products while driving business growth and improving lives globally.","website":"www.godrejcp.com","location":"Mumbai, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:23:03.974Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":929.5,"changePct":3.6867644598137046,"week52High":1254,"week52Low":818},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹95,131 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹16,638 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"481,027,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"689"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"324,527,160"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"2.15%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"7.52"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.07"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.8"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-3%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"48.09"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"48–73"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"14.7%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"24.32"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,491,195"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,209,286"},{"label":"Master score","value":"48"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"34"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"41"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"82"},{"label":"Acc